  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total number of ways in which the letters of the word 'PROBABILITY can be amanged in a row $=\\frac{11!}{2!2 !}$\r\nNumber of ways in which two B's are togother $=\\frac{10!}{2!}$\r\n$\\therefore$ Required probability\r\n$=\\frac{\\frac{10}{2 !}}{\\frac{11!}{2!2!}}=\\frac{10 ! \\times 2!}{11!}=\\frac{2}{11}$",
    "image": null
